{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0304_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a45b64cb5c44f85c042f2e896400f024639ed78b2595ea80c0915b80d16909d9", "ja": "（ようやく劇場に戻って来られた……。\n今日は打ち合わせのオンパレードだったな）", "zh": "（总算回到剧场了……\n今天真是开了一场又一场的会啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
