{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0304_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3f91d05ab7eed6beb5bc0fcfa46ef1c237d6a8606fcaf17e89570bc2aafe0ff2", "ja": "す、すまん……。って、真美？\n何か約束してたか？", "zh": "对、对不起……等等，真美？\n我们约好过什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
