{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0304_1004_p", "source_sha256": "abd93ff52f328c8559022a9783d88187f273e8225136326bafb7b7c072fab912", "ja": "なんだ……約束を破ったのかとヒヤヒヤしたよ。\nあれ？　服も新しいけど、髪型も変えてるんだな。", "zh": "什么嘛……我还以为你违背约定了，吓了我一跳。\n咦？衣服是新的，连发型也换了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0304_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "e8e9277fe3013a27041252236155c54d31ddd889fb64b94b28cffcb1669072ea", "ja": "だって、兄ちゃんがなかなか戻ってこないんだもん。\nヒマだから、いろいろ試してたのである！", "zh": "因为哥哥一直迟迟没回来嘛。\n闲着没事，就试了各种各样的造型！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0304_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "f75b52b216fc703b37f938cb91e2a1a5e1ff3e5feae0fbc0cf33d2cb36fd80b7", "ja": "亜美と一緒に、究極のアレンジを追求したんだよ～！\nんっふっふ～♪　おかげで、今の真美は完全体！", "zh": "和亚美一起追求终极改编哦～！\n哼哼哼～♪ 多亏了这个，现在的真美可是完全体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0304_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "d72d919cb34aff062e1106cfad048ad9a66afb43e98354b6a9a511c1e29dc885", "ja": "どうですかな、兄ちゃん君？\nあまりのカワイさに、言葉も出ないっしょ？", "zh": "怎么样呀，哥哥？\n可爱得让你连话都说不出来了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0304_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0f25594da7d44b90e94b5d5d7d13eed9827fff7e8296748424a1525c3d6bb991", "ja": "すごい自信だな……。でも、言うだけのことは\nあるよ。新しい服、可愛く着られてると思う。", "zh": "真是自信满满啊……不过，确实配得上你这么说。新衣服，我觉得你穿得很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0304_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6633cbcbbbf277f660ffac7e4267fc6d47589792152cc6d6a58f15b1de35eaf0", "ja": "髪型もいいアクセントになってるし、\nこのままステージに上がってもいいくらいだ。", "zh": "发型也成了很好的点缀，\n保持这样直接上台都没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0304_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "4a6ffda41500447c4d06e25937e21017c77c7f739e23e0a054a549ecf40bda8c", "ja": "えっ、ホント！？　もしかして、\n真美、オシャレ総番長になれる！？", "zh": "诶，真的！？难道说，\n真美能成为时尚总番长了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
