{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0304_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0304_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "f85d2ad4fb2a7765f3b7131bac0e0702c7dd565282f6b49d2a43ffef2ea58591", "ja": "まったく……朝からずっと待ってた真美を、\nちょっとはねぎらってほしいもんですな～。", "zh": "真是的……对于从一大早就一直等着的真美，\n好歹也希望能犒劳一下嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
